# Files a subagent worktree needs that git would otherwise omit.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so gitignored files are ABSENT from it.
# Executors that run tests fail without their environment. List those paths
# here — one glob per line — and the harness copies them into each agent
# worktree.
#
# This file ships with the patterns most projects need. Uncomment or add
# yours; nothing here is copied unless it actually exists in your checkout.

